<title>USA: Hills Stores Jan same-store sales rise.</title>
<headline>Hills Stores Jan same-store sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>CANTON, Mass. 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hills Stores Co said on Thursday that its same-store sales rose 11.4 percent in January, but declined 1.7 percent for the year ending February 1.</p>
<p>Total sales for the four weeks ending February 1 were $82.4 million, up 12.4 percent from the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>For the full year, total sales were $1.88 billion, compared to $1.90 billion for the previous year.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
</text>
